# =============================================================================
# Spark Match Frontend (04-frontend) - .gitignore
# =============================================================================
# Generado por Angular CLI 21.2 + ajustes segun ADR-003 branch-based deployment.
# Version: 1.0.0 - 2026-07-09
# Stack: Angular 21 standalone, Vitest, Angular Material + SCSS, i18n nativo
